### 5.3 Insufficient display duration

If a caption contains too much text for its available acoustic interval:

1. Attempt to split at a valid boundary.
2. Check whether an adjacent subtitle can be retimed without violating synchronization.
3. Check whether the source transcript contains an authorized cleaned layer.
4. Evaluate whether the profile permits a different segmentation.
5. Report the remaining constraint.

